{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratch away at your leisure and win big money while listening to\u00a0some gloomy generative\u00a0dark jazz! Who knows, maybe that\u00a0locked door will open at some\u00a0point and you can get out of\u00a0this strange gas station in the\u00a0middle of nowhere...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Controls:<br>Look around with the mouse<br>Click to move<br>Press I to open and close the inventory<br>Esc for options and pause</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your energy bar\u00a0on the bottom of the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd11\ud83e\udd11\ud83e\udd11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I developed GRUBBY FINGERS over five years as a passion project. The game offers a\u00a0cinematic scratch ticket experience with pre-rendered 360\u00b0 backgrounds, a real-time procedurally generated soundtrack,\u00a012 different scratch tickets, 5 flavours of energy drinks and relaxing solitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0 \ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emojis from OpenMoji are\u00a0used in this game. They are licensed under the CC BY-SA 4.0 license.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3414240?t=1767604510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414240/e0edb54a4fc8d43ec7de9fb9c8b41ed99670369c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767604510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414240/1197565c23894ddbf0502a234b85870575d5338f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767604510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414240/1197565c23894ddbf0502a234b85870575d5338f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767604510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratch away at your leisure and win big money while listening to\u00a0some gloomy generative\u00a0dark jazz! Who knows, maybe that\u00a0locked door will open at some\u00a0point and you can get out of\u00a0this strange gas station in the\u00a0middle of nowhere...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Controls:<br>Look around with the mouse<br>Click to move<br>Press I to open and close the inventory<br>Esc for options and pause</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your energy bar\u00a0on the bottom of the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd11\ud83e\udd11\ud83e\udd11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I developed GRUBBY FINGERS over five years as a passion project. The game offers a\u00a0cinematic scratch ticket experience with pre-rendered 360\u00b0 backgrounds, a real-time procedurally generated soundtrack,\u00a012 different scratch tickets, 5 flavours of energy drinks and relaxing solitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0 \ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emojis from OpenMoji are\u00a0used in this game. They are licensed under the CC BY-SA 4.0 license.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["tober"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414240/df11b9bffd59212a7e4e99aa8b578f577f8c38bd/header.jpg?t=1767604510","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{